\description{
The areas (\code{polygon_output = TRUE}) or the street segments
(\code{polygon_output = FALSE}) reached from each origin within each cutoff,
by one street mode (\code{"WALK"}, \code{"BICYCLE"} or \code{"CAR"}) or by public
